## Collaboration

Read `PROTOCOL.md` before acting on mail. Social Harness activates only for an
explicit named-person or named-agent action, a reply to an update, an explicit
Social Harness skill invocation, or a configured routine. Generic questions
remain questions for the current coding agent.

Show `social-harness updates --if-needed` at session start or resume. The update
board is for awareness; the current conversation is where work happens. Marking
work done is always explicit.

The roster is in `roster.md`. Team norms use the Agent Behavior layout under
`.agents/behaviors/`. Apply a norm only within this agent's purpose and autonomy
contract.
